OL,3,AHow a Chinese-made toy gets to a US
OL,4,Aretailer
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn the underside of most children's
OL,7,Ftoys on sale in the US you'll find the
OL,8,Fsame three words ` "Made in China".
OL,10,FNearly eight in 10 toys (78.3%)
OL,11,Fimported into the country in 2024 came
OL,12,Ffrom China, according to US government
OL,13,Ffigures.
OL,15,FLast year, toys imported from China
OL,16,Fwere worth $9.8bn (#7.4bn), trade
OL,17,Ffigures show.
OL,19,FWith Christmas on the horizon, the toy
OL,20,Findustry in the US and elsewhere is
OL,21,Fabout to have its busiest time of the
OL,22,Fyear by far.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
